      "message": "\u003e @subrata,\n\u003e question about AP GPP_E05. wanted to check when this signal\n\u003e gets asserted (if at all).\n\nUSB_A0_RT_RST_ODL is getting asserted in ramstage by coreboot so, ~800ms after poweron the AP, this GPIO PAD is getting configured\n\n\u003e hoping to find a robust timing window\n\u003e for the EC to apply ps8811 tuning parameters. \n\u003e arbitrarily waiting a few seconds seems very fragile.\n\nCan you please share what is expected from AP FW in such a case?",
